  "description": "Glowfall Vale is a relaxing walking simulator set in a mystical realm filled with soft magic, glowing landscapes, and ancient forgotten paths. Explore freely through enchanted valleys, luminous forests, floating lights, and quiet ruins where magic gently flows through the land. There are no objectives, no combat, and no danger — only wonder and calm.\n\nAs you walk, the world softly glows around you. Bioluminescent plants light the paths, magical particles drift through the air, and gentle ambient sounds create a dreamlike atmosphere. Glowfall Vale is designed to feel peaceful, warm, and otherworldly — a place to slow down and simply explore.\n\nFeatures:\n> Relaxing Walking Simulator – Stress-free exploration with no combat or fail states\n> Mystical Fantasy Realm – Enchanted valleys and glowing flora\n> Magical Atmosphere – Soft lighting, floating lights, and ambient magic effects\n> Soothing Soundscape – Calm music and subtle magical ambience\n> Meditative Experience – Built for relaxation, reflection, and escape\n\nGlowfall Vale invites curiosity without pressure. Follow glowing trails, pause beside shimmering waterfalls, or stand quietly as magical lights drift past.",
